AND THE `μ_{ℓⁿ}`-FIXING CLAUSE COSTS NOTHING AT ANY `n`. For every `g : Γ F` the
COMMUTATOR `σ_g = c g c⁻¹ g⁻¹` lies in `Γ F` and fixes every `ℓⁿ`-th root of
