THE COUNTEREXAMPLE. Take `ℓ = 7` (so `ℓ ≥ 5` and `#k = 7 ≡ 3 mod 4`),
`k = 𝔽₇` discrete, `R = ℤ_[7]`, and let `E/ℚ` be the curve

