Write `M = ad⁰ρbar(1)`, a discrete `Γ F`-module on which `Γ F` acts through a
finite quotient, and let `z` be a continuous `1`-cocycle representing `c`.

* `N₁ := ker(Γ F → Aut_k M)` is open normal of index at most `#Aut_k M`; the
