with `hglue`, `πA` and `hπsurj` deleted), checked by hand 2026-07-30.  Take a
field `k`, and
* `A = k[u,w]/(u², w²)`, a local `k`-algebra with residue field `k`;
* `C = k ⊕ k·u ⊕ k·uw ⊆ A`, a subring (`u² = 0`, `u·uw = 0`), local with the
